"The customization above adds :func:`~django.urls.resolve` "
"and :func:`~django.urls.reverse` to the default namespace, which already "
"includes all models from the apps listed in :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`. These "
"objects will be available in the ``shell`` without requiring a manual import."
