"a sholáthar nuair a thagann earráid Is féidir le hinnill teimpléad "
"saincheaptha na crúcaí seo a úsáid chun an fhaisnéis rianaithe a "
"fheabhsaíonn d'úsáideoirí. Tá na crúcaí seo a leanas ar fáil:"

msgid "Template postmortem"
msgstr "Teimpléad iar-bháis"

msgid ""
"The postmortem appears when :exc:`~django.template.TemplateDoesNotExist` is "
"raised. It lists the template engines and loaders that were used when trying "
"to find a given template. For example, if two Django engines are configured, "
"the postmortem will appear like:"
msgstr ""
"Feictear an post mortem nuair a ardaítear: exc: "
"`~django.template.templateDoesNotExist`. Liostaíonn sé na hinnill teimpléid "
"agus na luchtóirí a úsáideadh agus iad ag iarraidh teimpléad ar leith a "
"fháil. Mar shampla, má tá dhá innill Django cumraithe, beidh an post mortem "
"le feiceáil mar:"

msgid ""
"Custom engines can populate the postmortem by passing the ``backend`` and "
"``tried`` arguments when "
"raising :exc:`~django.template.TemplateDoesNotExist`. Backends that use the "
"postmortem :ref:`should specify an origin <template-origin-api>` on the "
"template object."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le hinnill saincheaptha an post mortem a líonadh trí na hargóintí "
"``backend`` agus `tried` a rith agus iad ag ardú: exc: "
"`~django.template.templateDoesNotExist`. <template-origin-api>Ba chóir go "
"mbeadh cúltaca a úsáideann an postmortem:ref: `bunús 'a shonrú ar réad an "
"teimpléid."

msgid "Contextual line information"
msgstr "Faisnéis líne comhthéacsúil"

msgid ""
"If an error happens during template parsing or rendering, Django can display "
"the line the error happened on. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Má tharlaíonn earráid le linn parsála nó rindreála teimpléad, is féidir le "
"Django an líne a tharla an earráid air a thaispeáint. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"Custom engines can populate this information by setting a ``template_debug`` "
"attribute on exceptions raised during parsing and rendering. This attribute "
"is a :class:`dict` with the following values:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le hinnill saincheaptha an fhaisnéis seo a líonadh trí thréith "
"``template_debug`` a shocrú ar eisceachtaí a ardaítear le linn parsála agus "
"rindreála. Is é an tréith seo a: class: `dict` leis na luachanna seo a "
"leanas:"

msgid "``'name'``: The name of the template in which the exception occurred."
msgstr "````ainm``: Ainm an teimpléid inar tharla an eisceacht."

msgid "``'message'``: The exception message."
msgstr "```'teachtaireacht e'``: An teachtaireacht eisceachta."

msgid ""
"``'source_lines'``: The lines before, after, and including the line the "
"exception occurred on. This is for context, so it shouldn't contain more "
"than 20 lines or so."
msgstr ""
"```'source_lines'``: Na línte roimh, tar éis, agus lena n-áirítear an líne a "
"tharla an eisceacht air. Tá sé seo le haghaidh comhthéacs, mar sin níor "
"chóir go mbeadh níos mó ná 20 líne nó mar sin ann."

msgid "``'line'``: The line number on which the exception occurred."
msgstr "``'líne '``: An uimhir líne ar tharla an eisceacht."

msgid ""
"``'before'``: The content on the error line before the token that raised the "
"error."
msgstr ""
"```roimh``: An t-ábhar ar an líne earráide roimh an comhartha a d'ardaigh an "
"earráid."

msgid "``'during'``: The token that raised the error."
msgstr "````le linn '``: An comhartha a d'ardaigh an earráid."

msgid ""
"``'after'``: The content on the error line after the token that raised the "
"error."
msgstr ""
"````tar éis '``: An t-ábhar ar an líne earráide tar éis an chomhartha a "
"d'ardaigh an earráid."

msgid "``'total'``: The number of lines in ``source_lines``."
msgstr "``'iomlán'``: Líon na línte i ``source_lines``."

msgid "``'top'``: The line number where ``source_lines`` starts."
msgstr "``'top'``: An uimhir líne ina dtosaíonn ``source_lines``."

msgid "``'bottom'``: The line number where ``source_lines`` ends."
msgstr "``'bottom'``: An uimhir líne ina gcríochnaíonn ``source_lines``."

