"``simple_tag`` functions may accept any number of positional or keyword "
"arguments. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh feidhmeanna ``simple_tag ``glacadh le haon líon argóintí seasaimh "
"nó eochairfhocal. Mar shampla::"

