"specified otherwise, logger mappings will propagate the records they process "
"to their parents - a record from a logger in the ``my_app.views.private`` "
"namespace will be handled by a mapping for both ``my_app`` and "
"``my_app.views``."
msgstr ""
"Is é ainmniú logger* ordlathach*. Is é `my_app`` tuismitheoir "
"``my_app.views``, arb é tuismitheoir ``my_app.views.private``. Mura "
"sonraítear a mhalairt, iomadóidh mapáil logger na taifid a phróiseálann siad "
"dá dtuismitheoirí - déanfar taifead ó logálaí sa spás ainmneacha "
"``my_app.views.private`` a láimhseáil le mapáil do ``my_app`` agus "
"`my_app.views`` araon."

