msgid "How to create CSV output"
msgstr "Conas aschur CSV a chruthú"

msgid ""
"This document explains how to output CSV (Comma Separated Values) "
"dynamically using Django views. To do this, you can either use the Python "
"CSV library or the Django template system."
msgstr ""
"Míníonn an doiciméad seo conas CSV (Luachanna Scartha Coma) a aschur go "
"dinimiciúil ag úsáid radhairc Django. Chun seo a dhéanamh, is féidir leat "
"leabharlann Python CSV nó an córas teimpléid Django a úsáid."

msgid "Using the Python CSV library"
msgstr "Leabharlann Python CSV a úsáid"

msgid ""
"Python comes with a CSV library, :mod:`csv`. The key to using it with Django "
"is that the :mod:`csv` module's CSV-creation capability acts on file-like "
"objects, and Django's :class:`~django.http.HttpResponse` objects are file-"
"like objects."
msgstr ""
"Tagann Python le leabharlann CSV,: mod: `csv`. Is é an eochair chun é a "
"úsáid le Django ná go ngníomhaíonn cumas cruthaithe CSV an mhodúil:mod: "
"`csv` ar rudaí cosúil le comhad, agus is rudaí cosúil le comhad iad rudaí "
"djangos:class: `~django.http.http.HttpResponse`."

msgid "Here's an example::"
msgstr "Seo sampla::"

msgid ""
"The code and comments should be self-explanatory, but a few things deserve a "
"mention:"
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh an cód agus na tuairimí féinmhínithe, ach tá cúpla rud "
"tuillte ag lua:"

msgid ""
"The response gets a special MIME type, :mimetype:`text/csv`. This tells "
"browsers that the document is a CSV file, rather than an HTML file. If you "
"leave this off, browsers will probably interpret the output as HTML, which "
"will result in ugly, scary gobbledygook in the browser window."
msgstr ""
"Faigheann an freagra cineál speisialta MIME,: mimetype: `text/csv`. Insíonn "
"sé seo do bhrabhsálaithe gur comhad CSV é an doiciméad, seachas comhad HTML. "
"Má fhágann tú é seo amach, is dócha go léirmhíníonn brabhsálaithe an t-"
"aschur mar HTML, rud a bheidh mar thoradh air go mbeidh gobbledygook gránna, "
"scanrúil i bhfuinneog an bhrabhsálaí."

msgid ""
"The response gets an additional ``Content-Disposition`` header, which "
"contains the name of the CSV file. This filename is arbitrary; call it "
"whatever you want. It'll be used by browsers in the \"Save as...\" dialog, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Faigheann an freagra ceannteideal breise ``Content-Disposition`, ina bhfuil "
"ainm an chomhaid CSV. Tá an t-ainm comhaid seo treallach; glaoigh air cibé "
"rud is mian leat. Úsáidfidh brabhsálaithe é sa dialóg “Sábháil mar...”, srl."

msgid ""
"You can hook into the CSV-generation API by passing ``response`` as the "
"first argument to ``csv.writer``. The ``csv.writer`` function expects a file-"
"like object, and :class:`~django.http.HttpResponse` objects fit the bill."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat dul isteach sa API giniúna CSV trí `freagra ``a chur ar "
"aghaidh mar an chéad argóint chuig `csv.writer``. Tá súil ag an bhfeidhm "
"``csv.writer`` réad cosúil le comhad, agus:class: "
"`~django.http.httpResponse` rudaí oiriúnach don bhille."

msgid ""
"For each row in your CSV file, call ``writer.writerow``, passing it "
"an :term:`iterable`."
msgstr ""
"I gcás gach sraith i do chomhad CSV, glaoigh ar `writer.writerow``, ag rith "
"u:term: `iterable`."

msgid ""
"The CSV module takes care of quoting for you, so you don't have to worry "
"about escaping strings with quotes or commas in them. Pass ``writerow()`` "
"your raw strings, and it'll do the right thing."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an modúl CSV aire do luachan duit, mar sin ní gá duit a bheith "
"buartha faoi teaghráin a éalú le luachana nó camóga iontu. Pas ``writerow () "
"``do theagáin amh, agus déanfaidh sé an rud ceart."

msgid "Streaming large CSV files"
msgstr "Comhaid mhóra CSV a shruthú"

msgid ""
"When dealing with views that generate very large responses, you might want "
"to consider using Django's :class:`~django.http.StreamingHttpResponse` "
"instead. For example, by streaming a file that takes a long time to generate "
"you can avoid a load balancer dropping a connection that might have "
"otherwise timed out while the server was generating the response."
msgstr ""
"Agus tú ag déileáil le tuairimí a ghineann freagraí an-mhóra, b'fhéidir gur "
"mhaith leat smaoineamh ar django's:class: "
"`~django.http.StreamInghttPresponse` a úsáid ina ionad. Mar shampla, trí "
"chomhad a shruthú a thógann sé tamall fada chun a ghiniúint is féidir leat "
"cothromóir ualaigh a sheachaint ag scaoileadh nasc a d'fhéadfadh a bheith "
"curtha amach ar shlí eile agus an freastalaí ag giniúint an freagra."

msgid ""
"In this example, we make full use of Python generators to efficiently handle "
